# ==============================================================================
# FleetPulse - Environment Variables Configuration
# ==============================================================================
#
# FleetPulse supports both Neon PostgreSQL and a seamless zero-config
# in-memory fallback.
#
# If DATABASE_URL is not set:
#   The application runs automatically in Mock / In-Memory mode with rich
#   seed data (Thabo Mokoena, Booysens / Rosettenville routes, fuel receipts).
#
# If DATABASE_URL is provided:
#   The application automatically connects to Neon PostgreSQL serverless,
#   executes initDb() to auto-create all tables (locations, drivers, trips,
#   fuel_logs, pricing_settings), and seeds initial data.
#
# ==============================================================================
# HOW TO GET YOUR FREE NEON POSTGRESQL DATABASE URL:
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Sign up or log in at https://neon.tech (Free Tier available, no credit card required)
# 2. Click "Create Project" and choose a project name (e.g., "fleetpulse-prod")
# 3. Select a region closest to your users (e.g. eu-west-1 or af-south-1)
# 4. Once your project is created, copy the "Connection String" shown on the dashboard.
#    It looks like:
#    postgresql://user:password@ep-cool-fog-123456.eu-central-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
# 5. Create a file named `.env.local` in your project root and paste your connection string below.
#
# ==============================================================================
# DEPLOYMENT ON VERCEL:
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Push your repository to GitHub / GitLab.
# 2. In Vercel Dashboard -> Project Settings -> Environment Variables:
#    Key:   DATABASE_URL
#    Value: postgresql://user:password@ep-cool-fog-123456.eu-central-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
# 3. Redeploy or trigger your first build.
# ==============================================================================

# Neon Serverless PostgreSQL Connection String
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://neondb_owner:YOUR_PASSWORD@ep-sample-pool-123456.eu-central-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
